on this matrix over here after reordering, we can see that the total number of non-zero,

34:56.020 --> 35:04.980
it becomes 78,120, which is lesser than what we began with and it's also lesser than this example

35:05.060 --> 35:13.620
over here, where we simply naively apply a Kolosky decomposition on the sparse matrix of A,

