And it seems like, apparently it seems like nested dissection has the best performance in this

36:41.940 --> 36:49.300
particular example, where it gives the least number of non-zero after Kolosky factorization.

36:49.300 --> 36:55.940
And what this means is that because Kolosky decomposition, it turns A into LL transpose,

